          "source_cycle": 2,
          "source_completion_round": 1,
          "body": "In engine.rs lines 410-411, `substrate_oxygenation_breakdown()` is called once for tracing metrics, then `step_substrate_zones()` calls it again internally. Each invocation recomputes the full habitat registry via `compute_habitat_registry()`. Refactor `step_substrate_zones` to accept a pre-computed `SubstrateOxygenationBreakdown` (or return one alongside applying it) to avoid the redundant computation.",
